value R70 10K
value C1 10uF
value C2 6800pF
value C3 220pF
value C4 0.022uF
value C5 10uF
value C6 0.01uF
value C7 0.1uF
value C8 0.1uF
value C9 0.001uF
value C10 0.1uF
